# FlowTwin AI Client Environment Variables
# Google Maps Platform (Optional - Live Logistics Map runs out-of-the-box in Keyless Mode)
# Leave empty for zero-cost, zero-configuration autonomous map (ESRI Dark Canvas, no key needed).
# Optionally supply a Google Maps API Key or free Maps Demo Key to use Google Maps Platform:
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID=DEMO_MAP_ID

